F-04, the engine install block and a parent package.json. Run on 2026-09-29 with
dash (/bin/sh), the real curl against the pinned raw.githubusercontent URLs, and
npm 10.9.7 on Node 22.22.2. <tmp> is a scratch directory; no directory above it
holds a package.json or node_modules. Each block is exactly what
src/lib/engine-install-block.ts renders from src/data/platform-engine-candidate.json
at the commit named.

